Utilities for bean development (JakartaEE 8).

# Usage

```xml
<project ...>
...
  <dependency>
    <groupId>${project.groupId}</groupId>
    <artifactId>${project.artifactId}</artifactId>
    <version>${project.version}</version>
  </dependency>
...
</project>
```

## JakartaEE dependencies

This module depends on the following JakartaEE 8- based dependencies:

- `javax.validation:validation-api:2.0.1.Final`
- `javax.xml.bind:jaxb-api:2.3.1`

# Features

Provides utilities for implementation and management of POJO Java Beans.

- [Bean identities](./identities.html)

  Abstraction mechanism for entity identities on beans, also known as
  "Primary ID" or "Primary Key".

- [Bean references](./references.html)

  Annotation based mechanism to declare and validate bean based references to
  unique entity references.

- [Apache Commons BeanUtils converters](converters.html)

  Adds extra supported conversions to Apache Commons BeanUtils.

- **Experimental** [SPI based Jackson polymorphism](jackson.html#spi-based-polymorphism)

  Adds SPI based name based polymorphism to Jackson.
